@KatelynKim did you run the following?

supabase stop

npx supabase@2.15.3 start

> I am running into this error on v2.15.8 when I try to save email config (trying to turn on confirm email)
> 
> ```
> {"data":null,"error":{"message":"Method PATCH Not Allowed"}}
> ```

@roberthenderson please don't lump unrelated issues into a thread that is dealing with a completely different issue. You cannot save email config from the dashboard when using the CLI or self-hosting, you can to set those in a `config.toml` file. Please create a different issue or better yet ask about your issue on the GitHub discussions.
